{"id":"vsled","lemma":"вслед","pos":"prep","rank":4167,"glosses":["after, behind, following"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/00/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B4.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B4.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы побежали вслед за вором.","en":"We ran after the thief.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,null,{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"thief","l":"вор"}]},{"text":"Том вышел из дома вслед за Мэри.","en":"Tom followed Mary out of the house.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"},{"g":"from / out of"},{"g":"at home"},null,{"g":"behind / for"},null]},{"text":"Директор вошёл вслед за учителем.","en":"The principal came in after the teacher.","words":[{"g":"manager"},{"g":"to enter","l":"войти"},null,{"g":"behind / for"},null]},{"text":"Вслед за молнией грянул гром.","en":"After the lightning, came the thunder.","words":[null,{"g":"behind / for"},null,null,{"g":"thunder, thunderbolt"}]},{"text":"Я не видел, чтобы кто-то шёл вслед за нами.","en":"I didn't see anybody following us.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},{"g":"that...should"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},null,{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"we","l":"мы"}]}]}